{FullMatrix[propagator, w, s], PropagatorMatrix[propagator, w, s]}\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"d834f942-1a6d-4845-af40-cb2097e54e51"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["GammaAtom[h, hbar, 0][s]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.12, 0.1],
  Background->GrayLevel[0.92]],
 " stands for the coefficient of (i",
